# Project conventions

Design source of truth: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-ai-chat-platform-design.md`

- Modular monolith under `apps/api` with `domain` → `application` → `adapters`.
- No medical/product role names in code, API, or default scenarios.
- Assistant replies must expose resolved `model_id` (API, SSE, UI, DB).
- Prefer ports + FakeLLM for tests; no real LLM keys in CI.
- Before non-trivial architecture changes, update or follow the design spec.
